+ <section id="contact"><h2>Contact us</h2><p>Email <a href="mailto:hello@kredit.com.ng">hello@kredit.com.ng</a>. You can raise a complaint without signing in, including if you have lost account access.</p><p>Write to KREDIT TECHNOLOGIES LIMITED (RC 9834452), House No. 348, Jamaina Road, Pompomari Bypass, Maiduguri, Borno State, Nigeria.</p><p>For an existing transaction, use the dispute controls in your <a href="/buyer/disputes">buyer account</a> or <a href="/app/disputes">supplier account</a> to attach the concern to its record.</p></section>
